  "steps": [
    "To a blender add 80g cashews, 450g Greek yogurt, 1 scoop protein powder (chocolate), 80g dates, 120ml skimmed milk, 2 tsp vanilla extract, A pinch of salt.",
    "Blend it well and divide evenly between 3 serving pots and top each one with 20g chia seeds.",
    "Refrigerate for 2 to 3 hours, or overnight, until thick and mousse like.",
    "Serve with 10g dark chocolate or fruit."
